# Offline TS pin notes (gpw-ts-ice)

CP2K 2026.1 stock `PAIR_POTENTIAL TYPE` has no `TS` (only DFTD2/D3/D3BJ/D4).
Hard pin is **libMBD** free-atom TS + pure real-space lattice sum — see
`regressions/gpw/gpw-ts-ice/REFERENCE.md`.

Isolated libMBD check (build libmbd, link OpenBLAS):

```text
Dispersion energy (isolated): -5.9764872295816794e-04 Eh
```

Periodic pure-RS (rcut 50 Å): -6.0996307733860822e-04 Ha — libMBD Fortran
`get_ts_energy` no-Ewald branch (`ewald_on = false`, `dipole_cutoff = 50 Å`);
driver + build line: `tools/cp2k_oracle/inputs/gpw-ts-stress/`. (An earlier
revision of this note recorded -6.099626368528631e-04 from a pre-shell-fix
lattice sum — 4.4e-9 off the pinned value; superseded.)

Geometry: same water dimer / 12 Å cell as `gpw-pbe-d3bj-ice`.
